## Auth (Critical — Do Not Break)

- Frontend: Clerk `@clerk/react` — `<ClerkProvider>` wraps the app
- API: Clerk `@clerk/express` — every route checks `getAuth(req).userId`
- Cross-origin: `customFetch` in `lib/api-client-react/src/custom-fetch.ts` sends `credentials: 'include'`
- **Never remove `credentials: 'include'` from customFetch. This is what sends the Clerk session cookie cross-origin. Removing it breaks every API call with 401.**
- CORS: `cors({ credentials: true, origin: true })` on API server

